    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Nestled in a peaceful countryside setting, this superb four-bedroom detached dormer home offers spacious family living just minutes from the stunning Lacken Strand, beautiful local beaches, and scenic coastal walks.\n\nThe well-appointed accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a bright sitting room with an open fireplace, a bright & spacious conservatory and an airy open-plan kitchen/living area featuring fitted kitchen units, tiled flooring in the kitchen, timber flooring in the living area, a solid-fuel stove, and a bay window overlooking the surrounding countryside. \n\nA utility room, guest bathroom and bedroom complete the layout on the ground floor.\n\nUpstairs are a further three generously sized bedrooms, with the master bedroom featuring an ensuite and walk-in wardrobe.\n\nTo the outside are front and rear gardend, paved patio area to the rear and a shed.\n\nSet on a private and secure site, this attractive home enjoys beautiful countryside views and offers the perfect balance of rural tranquillity and coastal living, making it an ideal choice for families or those seeking a peaceful retreat."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Front Porch - 1.98m x 1.35m\n\n\nEntrance Hall - 7.32m x 2.9m\nBright & spacious hallway.\n\nSitting Room - 4.57m x 3.96m\nOpen fire.\n\nConservatory - 3.66m x 3.96m\n\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 3.84m x 3.53m\nTiled floor.Fitted kitchen.\n\nLiving area: - 3.56m x 3.18m\nOpen plan into the kitchen.Wood floor.\n\nUtility - 2.18m x 2.77m\n\n\nW/C - 1.22m x 2.18m\nOff the utility.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.3m x 4.11m\nDownstairs double bedroom.\n\nBathroom - 3.05m x 2.9m\n\n\nLanding - 4.3m x 2.9m\n\n\nMaster Bedroom - 4.57m x 4.11m\n\n\nEn-suite - 2.16m x 2.13m\nElectric Shower.\n\nWalk-in-Wardrobe - 1.83m x 1.83m\nShelves & rails fitted.\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.11m x 2.92m\nBack double bedroom. Built in wardrobe & storage.\n\nBedroom 4 - 4.11m x 3.05m\nFront double bedroom.Fitted Sliderobes.\n\nShower Room - 2.44m x 2.13m\n\n\nGarage/shed - 8.23m x 4.57m"
      },
      {
